              "whyItMatters": "Imbalance can affect power and the robustness of the rank test if distribution shapes differ. May hint at selection bias.",
              "actionableFix": "Comment on the imbalance, test for shape differences (e.g., Kolmogorov-Smirnov), and consider reporting standardized effect sizes.",
              "reentryPoint": "manuscript",
